guarantee: line 2 (T-034 v1): the draft stays dirty after a Refused save (a close request still asks to discard)
file: src/lib/settings/draft.ts
added_by: test-writer
test: pnpm e2e --workers=2 e2e/settings-autostart.spec.ts -g "failure branch: settings_save Refused"
--- old
